<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>Cloaks｜Yiiewang</title><description>Cloaks｜Yiiewang 的个人站点 —— 博客记录思考过程，知识库沉淀能力体系。涵盖技术、工程实践、思维方法、领域知识、人文素养、工具效率和职业发展七大能力域。欢迎浏览、搜索和留言讨论。</description><link>https://cloaks.cn/</link><atom:link href="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <managingEditor>Cloaks｜Yiiewang</managingEditor><docs>https://github.com/yiiewang/yiiewang.github.io</docs><language>zh</language> <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 09:26:16 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 09:26:16 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.17.9</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>Cloaks｜Yiiewang</title> <link>https://cloaks.cn/</link> </image> <item> <title>Mailbox 里没有锁：Actor 模型与单写者哲学</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Actor 模型</category> <category>Go</category> <category>MPSC</category> <category>单写者</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>系统设计</category> <description>从无锁队列的归并写者出发讲透 Actor 模型：mailbox 为什么天然 MPSC、锁如何变成串行化的副产品、事件溯源与 Go channel 如何共享同一套单写者哲学，以及消息死锁、背压、顺序保证这几个必踩的坑。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09-1/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09-1/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09-1/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/09-1.png" type="image/png" length="73985" /> </item> <item> <title>一行 ProxyJump，VS Code 直达内网机器</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ProxyJump</category> <category>Remote-SSH</category> <category>SSH</category> <category>VS Code</category> <category>札记</category> <category>远程开发</category> <description>内网机器藏在跳板机后面，逐级手动 SSH 再开发是原始人操作。在 ~/.ssh/config 里写一行 ProxyJump，VS Code 就能一键直达目标机器，跳板机只转发流量、不留私钥。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/09/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/09.png" type="image/png" length="79427" /> </item> <item> <title>两个生产者之后：给无锁环形队列加同步的三条路</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>CAS</category> <category>Go</category> <category>MPSC</category> <category>Ring Buffer</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>无锁</category> <category>系统设计</category> <description>SPSC 无锁队列被第二个生产者击穿之后怎么修：CAS 认领加提交计数、生产者侧 mutex、per-slot 序列号与归并写者，三条路线的完整 Go 实现与选型对比。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07-1/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07-1/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07-1/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/07-1.png" type="image/png" length="65610" /> </item> <item> <title>单写多读：无锁环形队列为什么敢不用锁</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Go</category> <category>Ring Buffer</category> <category>kfifo</category> <category>内存屏障</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>无锁</category> <category>系统设计</category> <description>SPSC 环形队列为什么敢不用锁：把每个共享字段收敛到唯一写者，写冲突自然消失，剩下的只是&#34;发布&#34;与&#34;观察&#34;两个动作，用 release/acquire 衔接。附最小 Go 实现与多生产者翻车现场。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/07/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/07.png" type="image/png" length="41807" /> </item> <item> <title>一个没有名字的持久化设计：五个经典思想的排列组合</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Double Buffering</category> <category>Ring Buffer</category> <category>Shadow Paging</category> <category>存储</category> <category>崩溃恢复</category> <category>系统设计</category> <description>从一个布谷鸟过滤器分片的落盘方案出发，溯源 Ring Buffer、脏页 writeback、双缓冲、WAL checkpoint 与 Shadow Paging 五个经典思想的来龙去脉，附 kfifo、Disruptor、InnoDB、LevelDB、ZFS、BoltDB 经典案例拆解。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/04-1/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/04-1/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/04-1/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/04-1.png" type="image/png" length="68605" /> </item> <item> <title>ps -ef | grep ssh 查不到的端口转发</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Remote-SSH</category> <category>SSH</category> <category>VSCode</category> <category>开发环境</category> <category>札记</category> <category>端口转发</category> <description>浏览器能访问 localhost:8000，服务器上 ps -ef | grep ssh 却查不到任何转发进程。复盘这次反直觉排查：对比 ssh -L 与 VSCode Remote-SSH 两条转发路线，说清为什么服务器端零转发进程，本地监听者到底是谁。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02-1/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02-1/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02-1/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/02-1.png" type="image/png" length="65074" /> </item> <item> <title>用反向 SSH 隧道穿透内网：一次完整的踩坑实践</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Linux</category> <category>SSH</category> <category>autossh</category> <category>内网穿透</category> <category>札记</category> <category>网络</category> <description>内网机没有公网 IP，用 ssh -R 反向隧道 + autossh 守护随时拿回 shell 的完整实践，重点记录 7 个真实踩到的坑——其中 pgrep 的 argv[0] 陷阱与 ClientAlive 缺失导致的僵尸监听，网上几乎查不到像样的说明。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/09/02/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/09/02.png" type="image/png" length="74724" /> </item> <item> <title>让 AI 落地，瓶颈往往不在模型</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI 落地</category> <category>LLM</category> <category>反馈闭环</category> <category>工程化</category> <category>札记</category> <category>黄金样本</category> <description>一张 AWS Summit 的幻灯片把 AI 落地说透了——瓶颈往往不在模型，在把「给人看」的业务说明书适配成「给 AI 看」的 Pipeline。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/31/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/31/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/31/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/07/31.png" type="image/png" length="58368" /> </item> <item> <title>读毛选《我们的经济政策》—— 战略与战术的辩证法</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>战略</category> <category>毛选</category> <category>经济学</category> <category>读书笔记</category> <category>读书笔记</category> <description>读毛选《我们的经济政策》的读书笔记。用&#34;战略与战术&#34;的框架拆解这篇经典：原则是纲，中心是目，提纲挈领才能成事。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/04/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/04/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/07/04/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/07/04.png" type="image/png" length="82322" /> </item> <item> <title>如何做一场有效的汇报？</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>札记</category> <category>汇报</category> <category>沟通</category> <category>表达技巧</category> <description>如何做一场有效的汇报？从内容设计到表达技巧，系统性地提升汇报能力，让领导听懂、认可并支持你的方案。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/30/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/30.png" type="image/png" length="57434" /> </item> <item> <title>集成测试流程设计方案</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI辅助</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>流程设计</category> <category>测试</category> <category>集成测试</category> <description>集成测试流程设计方案，明确研发与结对同学的分工协作，建立用例生成、审核、执行的标准化流程</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/15/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/15.png" type="image/png" length="59669" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 并发编程：锁与同步的 15 个反模式及正确做法</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Channel</category> <category>Go</category> <category>反模式</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>锁</category> <description>系统梳理 Go 并发编程中锁与同步的 15 个常见反模式及对应正确做法，结合长安链项目中 Stop/Close 机制、stopC 通道、context 级联等真实案例，给出可落地的并发安全准则。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/04/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/04.png" type="image/png" length="93362" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 并发资源关闭类缺陷排查实战 —— 从一个 SDK 死锁案例说起</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Channel</category> <category>Go</category> <category>sync.Once</category> <category>并发编程</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>死锁排查</category> <category>资源管理</category> <category>长安链</category> <description>一个真实的 Go 死锁案例——长安链 SDK-Go ClientConnectionPool.Close() 在重复调用 3 次后必然死锁。本文从问题模型、死锁推演、排查清单、修复范式四个维度系统总结 Go 中 Close/Stop 类方法的常见缺陷，给出可直接复用的排查清单、4 种修复范式、Channel 通知语义对照表和单测最低标准。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/06/03/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/06/03.png" type="image/png" length="87891" /> </item> <item> <title>长安链模块测试 · 实战手册（Module Test Playbook）</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>Go</category> <category>技术实践</category> <category>模块测试</category> <category>测试工程</category> <category>质量保障</category> <category>长安链</category> <description>长安链模块测试实战手册——从认知建立到落地执行的完整方法论。覆盖五件套架构、五大核心范式、6 维场景骨架、零侵入约束，附 store 模块真实案例和可复用模板，帮助研发同学在分钟级反馈内拦截过去只能靠跑链才能发现的 bug。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/27/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/27.png" type="image/png" length="58108" /> </item> <item> <title>环形缓冲区（Ring Buffer）：从原理到区块链交易去重的实战应用</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>ChainMaker</category> <category>区块链</category> <category>布谷鸟过滤器</category> <category>技术原理</category> <category>数据结构</category> <category>环形缓冲区</category> <description>环形缓冲区（Ring Buffer）是一种固定大小、O(1) 操作、自动淘汰的数据结构。本文从原理出发，结合 ChainMaker BirdsNest 模块的交易去重实战案例，解析环形缓冲区 + 布谷鸟过滤器如何以极低内存开销实现数百万级交易的高效去重。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/26/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/26.png" type="image/png" length="76555" /> </item> <item> <title>LangChain &amp;amp; LangGraph 学习路线图与水平定位</title> <author>CodeBuddy</author> <category>AI Agent</category> <category>AI开发</category> <category>LangChain</category> <category>LangGraph</category> <category>大模型应用开发</category> <category>学习路线图</category> <description>基于个人测评结果定制的 LangChain &amp; LangGraph 系统学习路线图，涵盖四阶段学习计划、水平定位分析、核心陡峭点识别及专属学习建议，总耗时预估2-3个月，从API调用到复杂决策Agent架构设计。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 07 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/05/07/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/05/07.png" type="image/png" length="80173" /> </item> <item> <title>当趋势策略遇上震荡市：一套全天候复合交易系统的设计手记</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>分步止盈</category> <category>炒股养家</category> <category>策略切换</category> <category>网格交易</category> <category>趋势跟踪</category> <category>量化策略</category> <category>风险管理</category> <description>为什么单一交易策略总是&#34;赚了又赔回去&#34;？一套三层架构的复合交易系统（V2.1），通过战略底仓、趋势跟踪和网格交易的智能协同，让震荡市和单边行情都能从容应对。新增三档阶梯止盈策略，用均线移动止损实现分批落袋与利润奔跑的平衡。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/</link> <pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/30/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/04/30.png" type="image/png" length="55504" /> </item> <item> <title>AI Prompt 工具箱：不同场景下的实用提示词</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>AI</category> <category>CodeBuddy</category> <category>Prompt</category> <category>工具</category> <category>工程实践</category> <description>记录日常开发中各类场景下实用的 AI Prompt，涵盖 Git 工作流、代码审查、博客写作、性能分析等，持续更新。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://cloaks.cn/feed_rss_created.xml">Cloaks｜Yiiewang</source><comments>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/#__comments</comments><guid isPermaLink="true">https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/04/15/</guid> <enclosure url="https://cloaks.cn/assets/images/social/blog/posts/2026/04/15.png" type="image/png" length="62446" /> </item> <item> <title>Go 优雅退出完全指南：signal.NotifyContext 实战</title> <author>Cloaks</author> <category>Go</category> <category>Go</category> <category>工程实践</category> <category>进程管理</category> <description>深入解析 Go 语言中利用 signal.NotifyContext 实现优雅退出的标准实践，涵盖 HTTP 服务器、批量任务、带清理的长时间运行任务等典型场景。</description> <link>https://cloaks.cn/blog/posts/2026/03/23/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubD